OL,3,ATwo-day sea search for missing teen on
OL,4,Aholiday is called off
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major sea search for a missing
OL,7,F15-year-old boy has been called off
OL,8,Fafter two days, the Coastguard has
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FAt about 15:30 BST on Sunday, HM
OL,12,FCoastguard received a report that three
OL,13,Fpeople were experiencing difficulty in
OL,14,Fthe water at Marloes Sands beach,
OL,15,FPembrokeshire.
OL,17,FTwo managed to get out of the water,
OL,18,Fbut the teenage boy, who was visiting
OL,19,Fthe area on holiday from Yorkshire, was
OL,20,Funaccounted for. The search was
OL,21,Fsuspended at 19:30 BST on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
